    "description": {
      "value": "You are a member of a Shoanti quah and have gone through its coming of age ceremony, gaining the traditional tattoo of your quah and earning your adult name.\n\nChoose two ability boosts. One must be to Strength or Wisdom, and one is a free ability boost.\n\nYou're trained in the Athletics skill and the Quah Lore skill. You gain the Combat Climber skill feat."
